    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac7bd722615a16440d7bb4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到我的研究室！如何，是个很能激发求知欲的房间对吧？\r\n顺便一提，另外一半是茶座的空间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "033d8d9d8d2bcb07728c1e963f8deb2ff5c5b22357794c5365097b827ca1ea90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
