    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c404b6bad3b9babfc72a3e3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随便乱碰的话，可能会引发不可预料的可怕事件，你小心点啊。\r\n要是我的研究资料全都燃起来了的话，我可是会哭的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1039aeadee63f35de1bdee020c0c5d9f71026bd626463290d43c8406732e57f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef18e4dfb517fcce8769a5b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真是片不可思议的空间啊。\r\n这儿仿佛从整个世界之中被剥离出去，\r\n但却处处显示着其与现实的联系……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd63ad9f0be82343803708c7660190e9699c76f35026b58cc7c0eca76649986",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
