    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a45a158da0fa51f3f8db80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要我是心理学家，要来解读这片如梦境一般的空间的话……\r\n一定会很有趣吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98d9c83357db01d70c0b1e38ba256e5f0b90156d685b84d51b26f989266d0c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eea655ff4baf0dca1f1fe233",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "茶座都说了『存在』了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17458425f17da5b1879f13ec9863ec98ffaa576375a9f79e9e067c6abb2d1a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cccc8a503e46d25554398c6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dad3031d1216ec6760d61d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，说回正题。\r\n你对于茶座的那个『朋友』怎么想？你觉得她真的存在吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "56cf03d71afd220c29cd36939d92b2d1c262a426b150c1ed3a55f6dc33a39d72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7128c057fcc9edd0534c5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dfbeaf73a312d69c7e2945a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔呣。暂时先把“存在”这个词的定义放在一边，\r\n你应该看不见她的那个『朋友』吧？\r\n当然啦，我也看不见。谁都看不见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d6322785a1efcab1e3a755add4f824df3be59a35045661002826ca9b167913",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724b7bb8b8673fee9e6a771d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼睛能看见的东西并不是一切哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e1fc7fb34c7b278e5a32ad2f43ad6747c1e228bc445be5d550661529465b6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f25f07bd87356770e6a6183",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119f5525324052fdde444d94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简直称得上是违背一切科学定理的存在。\r\n……就算如此，你还是相信那位『朋友』真的存在吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9a60caafdada4ffd958a607f395af8eac1ca5ef79092f2a605d04d0a379a02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34df33671f1963f673407bb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算是同一个东西，根据角度的不同，物体映在眼中的模样也会不同。\r\n某些东西只有某些人才看得见，这也是自然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81a17bd8c5f810d7e70f98748877826f697424b1848e0c3f0e746a4e3e9f0895",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42744ee48146c3edc15d672e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以也许不该用“看不见”来否认那位『朋友』的存在。\r\n我将我的想法告诉了爱丽速子——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f19c52438c3f3d97aabf85e52fe937e149a792b9dc5a54bcf5bf98e254ef13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1525e8822c3e7632851b34ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8096f628cfcfad45c5c5745c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！你，满分啊！\r\n这就是……这正是“未知”，也就是所谓的“可能性”！",
